The MC70 project provides an alternative firmware for Motorola MC micro transceivers to enable the use of those radios for HAM radio.

Check out the details on the projects homepage:

[http://mc70.stus-disco.de]()


<s>The poject uses the Telemark Cross Assembler (TASM) to create the executable. You can find the tool here: http://home.comcast.net/~tasm/</s>

Since TASM seems to be abandonware, you may use this compatible table-driven assembler: [https://github.com/dg1yfe/tabasm]()
